{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114104128301420545"]}, "author_id": "2896373517", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:18:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114104301245059296"], "id": "2114104301245059296", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 337, "like_count": 31, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113037027499208964", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "MUSK WANTS 440,000 NVIDIA VERA RUBIN SYSTEMS ONLINE BY Q2. FANTASTIC NEWS FOR NVIDIA INVESTORS?\nBUYS, BUILDS, RENTS OUT.\n\nEvery chip story says trust me.\nThis one comes with a quarterly report you can check. Here's what's in it: https://t.co/dvO0YDdM0a https://t.co/2lN4tacQbu", "url": "https://x.com/luellamech/status/2114104301245059296"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114113909359562752"]}, "author_id": "1429725410003062785", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:59:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114114594058707002"], "id": "2114114594058707002", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I don’t think folks realize just how insane DeepInfer is.\n\nOne cluster with DeepInfer. IN One day. Can produce AS MUCH tokens AS OpenRouter in an entire week.\n\n“A single cluster currently serves 155 trillion tokens per day, with overall revenue of US$38 per GPU-hour (at valley https://t.co/2XnYVV5cE3", "url": "https://x.com/0xkydo/status/2114114594058707002"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114105968032100352"]}, "author_id": "2108921330548482048", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:25:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114105970020253814"], "id": "2114105970020253814", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "BREAKING | Amazon SageMaker AI opens training sessions with no GPU management\n\nWhy it matters to you: Those who train models on AWS can write their own training loop without managing the GPUs, with token-based billing according to NeoTeo.\n\n#AI\nhttps://t.co/b76sfbFCxa https://t.co/mrQH2uQV4O", "url": "https://x.com/jumpdaily_EN/status/2114105970020253814"}, {"author_id": "23267952", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:56:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114113770662277126"], "id": "2114113770662277126", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tried gpu-unlock on my RTX 3060 12GB.\n\nBF16 matmul: 48.1 TFLOPS measured vs ~25 stock spec\nTF32: 23.6 vs ~12.7\n\nOn paper that puts it between a stock 3070 Ti and a 3080 for ML training, on a 3060.\n\nhttps://t.co/d9OybEvp1l", "url": "https://x.com/souuzaa/status/2114113770662277126"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114105197483933696"]}, "author_id": "1366093717678026753", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:22:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114105205700669636"], "id": "2114105205700669636", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1460, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Senior Vice President at Cast believes the long-term risk for neoclouds like $CRWV is that hyperscalers are aggressively developing custom silicon (internal accelerators) and self-building at massive scale, which may eventually reduce their dependence on third-party GPU lessors https://t.co/GoFUWaK3JO", "url": "https://x.com/SmallCapSnipa/status/2114105205700669636"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114109400616988672"]}, "author_id": "1623421089777844227", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:39:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114109602362958095"], "id": "2114109602362958095", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 72, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110472580679258160", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "For years, AdamW has been the default optimizer behind every LLM training run on the planet. A new optimizer called Muon is twice as computationally efficient - and the core idea is embarrassingly elegant: orthogonalize the momentum matrix. The same singular value decomposition https://t.co/RTZP5O0Qrt https://t.co/2e0TeE1yFO", "url": "https://x.com/0xDeliriumm/status/2114109602362958095"}, {"article": {"title": "Transformers Are Finally Dying (And What’s Replacing Them Isn’t What You Think)"}, "author_id": "983566318195458048", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:16:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114103852635152815"], "id": "2114103852635152815", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Transformers aren’t dying because attention stopped working.\n\nThey’re dying because the cost of remembering finally caught up.What’s actually replacing them isn’t what most people expect. https://t.co/lOcJ6RHihl", "url": "https://x.com/Noooblien/status/2114103852635152815"}, {"article": {"title": "Tesla Q3 2024 Earnings Call — Transcript"}, "author_id": "1923043417598099457", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:25:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114106080804434425"], "id": "2114106080804434425", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 151, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tesla Q3 2024 Earnings Call — Transcript https://t.co/dp9YsUJkJe", "url": "https://x.com/godfather_95931/status/2114106080804434425"}, {"article": {"title": "Tesla Q1 2024 Earnings Call — Transcript"}, "author_id": "1923043417598099457", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:20:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114104864879845623"], "id": "2114104864879845623", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 147, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tesla Q1 2024 Earnings Call — Trans